WEBVTT

NOTE Vantage Payments — reconciliation discovery

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Priya Raman>Walk me through month end. Where does it hurt?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Adaeze Nwosu>Reconciliation is four people for three days, and we still close two days later than the board wants.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.000
<v Adaeze Nwosu>The matching rules live in a spreadsheet that only Karel understands, and he retires in November.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Priya Raman>That sounds like the kind of thing that keeps a CFO up at night.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Adaeze Nwosu>It does. Honestly, if the system suggested the matches and we just approved them, that would change the job entirely.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
<v Priya Raman>Most of our customers approve about eighty per cent and only review the exceptions.
